-to-end" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 pl-[calc(var(--toc-padding-left)+var(--toc-focus-padding,0rem))] whitespace-pre-wrap focus-visible:[--toc-focus-padding:0.25rem] focus-visible:-ml-1 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 text-gray-500 [li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:[li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-300 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary-light">2. One agent owns the work end to end</a></li><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="1"><a style="--toc-padding-left:1rem" href="#3-the-agent-can-run-operate-and-observe-the-real-product" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 pl-[calc(var(--toc-padding-left)+var(--toc-focus-padding,0rem))] whitespace-pre-wrap focus-visible:[--toc-focus-padding:0.25rem] focus-visible:-ml-1 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 text-gray-500 [li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:[li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-300 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary-light">3. The agent can run, operate and observe the real product</a></li><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="1"><a style="--toc-padding-left:1rem" href="#4-plans-and-progress-live-in-files-in-the-repo" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 pl-[calc(var(--toc-padding-left)+var(--toc-focus-padding,0rem))] whitespace-pre-wrap focus-visible:[--toc-focus-padding:0.25rem] focus-visible:-ml-1 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 text-gray-500 [li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:[li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-300 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary-light">4. Plans and progress live in files in the repo</a></li><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="1"><a style="--toc-padding-left:1rem" href="#5-someone-else-decides-whether-it%E2%80%99s-right" class="group flex items-