</div></header><div class="mdx-content @container/columns-container relative mt-8 prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert [contain:inline-size] isolate empty:hidden mb-14" data-page-title="I stopped babysitting my coding agents. Here&#x27;s the workflow." data-page-href="/techblog/coding-agent-workflow-and-skills" id="content"><span data-ramka-trigger="" class="zoom-image-trigger contents cursor-zoom-in"><span class="contents"><picture class="contents"><img data-path="images/techblog/coding-agent-workflow-and-skills/cover.png" src="https://mintcdn.com/agent-en/QyrUhc9mUtXpvlSD/images/techblog/coding-agent-workflow-and-skills/cover.png?fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;n=QyrUhc9mUtXpvlSD&amp;q=85&amp;s=caf1fc8a7146c0ea4d30b9644f56fb76" alt="Cover: you set the goal and the check, the spec is frozen, one agent builds and proves it, another model verifies, you read the decisions and merge" class="object-contain" width="2000" height="802" decoding="async" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" srcSet="https://mintcdn.com/agent-en/QyrUhc9mUtXpvlSD/images/techblog/coding-agent-workflow-and-skills/cover.png?w=280&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;n=QyrUhc9mUtXpvlSD&amp;q=85&amp;s=a3879cfae4405e9aaede952a0af8eeaf 280w, https://mintcdn.com/agent-en/QyrUhc9mUtXpvlSD/images/techblog/coding-agent-workflow-and-skills/cover.png?w=560&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;n=QyrUhc9mUtXpvlSD&amp;q=85&amp;s=d688f36c76e7eeb9462ce8460f6f07bf 560w, https://mintcdn.com/agent-en/QyrUhc9mUtXpvlSD/images/techblog/coding-agent-workflow-and-skills/cover.png?w=840&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;n=QyrUhc9mUtXpvlSD&amp;q=85&amp;s=c33da74e28a2315d9d54cc3878734636 840w, https://mintcdn.com/agent-en/QyrUhc9mUtXpvlSD/images/techblog/coding-agent-workflow-and-skills/cover.png?w=1100&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;n=QyrUhc9mUtXpvlSD&amp;q=85&amp;s=3d4a67ece3ddef2dd392c07af614559f 1100w, https://mintcdn.com/agent-en/QyrUhc9mUtXpvlSD/images/techblog/coding-agent-workflow-and-skills/cover.png?w=1650&amp;fit=max&amp;au