 tabindex="-1" class="size-full rounded-[inherit] [--scroll-area-fade-size:32px] py-3.5 px-4 overflow-y-hidden! base-ui-disable-scrollbar" style="overflow:scroll" data-component-part="scroll-area-viewport"><div role="presentation" style="min-width:fit-content" data-component-part="scroll-area-content" class="min-w-full! h-full children:my-0! children:shadow-none! children:bg-transparent!"><div class="font-mono whitespace-pre leading-6"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light-default dark-plus" style="background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#0B0C0E;color:#1f2328;--shiki-dark:#D4D4D4" language="text"><code language="text" numberOfLines="5"><span class="line"><span>Install dev-skills for me: https://github.com/coder-xieshijie/dev-skills</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>Follow the &quot;From a clone&quot; steps in its README for the agent you&#x27;re running in.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>If the dev-skills plugin is already installed, stop and tell me instead.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>Then list the skills you linked.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span></code></pre></div></div></div></div><div class="code-block-fade-overlay print:hidden" data-fade-overlay="true" aria-hidden="true" style="--fade-color-light:#ffffff;--fade-color-dark:#0B0C0E"></div></div>
<span data-as="p">It clones the repo and links each skill into the folder your agent reads. To update later, ask it to pull the latest dev-skills. MCode is what I use every day, and the experience has been great. If you haven’t tried it yet, I’d really recommend it.</span>
<span data-as="p"><strong>Run</strong> it in the target repo:</span>
<div class="code-block mt-5 mb-8 not-prose rounded-2xl relative group min-w-0 print:print-color-exact text-gray-950 dark:text-gray-50 codeblock-light border border-gray-950/10 dark:border-white/10 dark:twoslash-dark bg-transparent dark:bg-transparent" data-has-floating-buttons="" numberOfLines="6" language="text"><div data-floating-buttons="true" class="absolute top-3 right-4 flex items-center gap-1.5 print:hidden"><div class="z-10 select-none" id="base-ui-_R_1tbc9bb9qnpfb39p7b9snpfiutb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><button class="size-6.5 flex items-center justify-center rounded-md group/code-snippet-feedback-button [.code-block:not(:has([data-fade-overlay]))_[data-floating-buttons]_&amp;]:bg-gray-100 dark:[.code-block:not(:has([data-fade-overlay]))_[data-floating-buttons]_&amp;]:bg-gray-800" id="code-snippet-feedback-button" aria-label="Report incorrect code"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-gray-400 group-hover/code-snippet-feedback-button:text-gray-500 dark:text-white/40 dark:group-hover/code-snippet-feedback-button:text-white/60"><path d="M9 5.431V9.569" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9 11.417C8.449 11.417 8 11.866 8 12.417C8 12.968 8.449 13.417 9 13.417C9.551 13.417 10 12.968 10 12.417C10 11.866 9.551 11.417 9 11.417Z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></path><path d="M10.968 2.25H7.03301C6.50301 2.25 5.99401 2.461 5.61901 2.836L2.83701 5.618C2.46201 5.993 2.25101 6.502 2.25101 7.032V10.967C2.25101 11.497 2.46201 12.006 2.83701 12.381L5.61901 15.163C5.99401 15.538 6.50301 15.749 7.03301 15.749H10.968C11.498 15.749 12.007 15.538 12.382 15.163L15.164 12.381C15.539 12.006 15.75 11.497 15.75 10.967V7.032C15.75 6.502 15.539 5.993 15.164 5.618L12.382 2.836C12.007 2.461 11.498 2.25 10.968 2.25Z" stroke="currentColor" 