 tabindex="-1" class="size-full rounded-[inherit] [--scroll-area-fade-size:32px] py-3.5 px-4 overflow-y-hidden! base-ui-disable-scrollbar" style="overflow:scroll" data-component-part="scroll-area-viewport"><div role="presentation" style="min-width:fit-content" data-component-part="scroll-area-content" class="min-w-full! h-full children:my-0! children:shadow-none! children:bg-transparent!"><div class="font-mono whitespace-pre leading-6"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light-default dark-plus" style="background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#0B0C0E;color:#1f2328;--shiki-dark:#D4D4D4" language="text"><code language="text" numberOfLines="6"><span class="line"><span>/core-grill The request is &lt;link or text&gt;. Put the docs in &lt;dir&gt;/.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>/core-spec Write spec.md and verify.md from the decision summary.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span># in a new session</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>/deliver Take over &lt;draft PR link&gt;.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span></code></pre></div></div></div></div><div class="code-block-fade-overlay print:hidden" data-fade-overlay="true" aria-hidden="true" style="--fade-color-light:#ffffff;--fade-color-dark:#0B0C0E"></div></div>
<ol>
<li>core-grill asks its questions. Answer them and confirm the decision summary.</li>
<li>core-spec writes spec and verify and has the other family check them for gaps. Read the result and confirm. It freezes both files and opens a draft PR.</li>
<li>deliver works until the PR is mergeable. Read the decision list at the top, then merge.</li>
</ol>
<span data-as="p">In Codex, write <code>$</code> instead of <code>/</code>.</span>
