\",\"href\":\"/code/get-started/first-task\"}]},{\"group\":\"Core Workflows\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Coding and Work Modes\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Coding and Work Modes\",\"description\":\"Understand when to use Coding mode or Work mode in MiniMax Code.\",\"href\":\"/code/workflows/modes\"},{\"title\":\"Workspace and Project Context\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Workspace and Project Context\",\"description\":\"Attach a local project so the Agent can understand your files, scripts, and conventions.\",\"href\":\"/code/workflows/workspace\"},{\"title\":\"Tasks and History\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Tasks and History\",\"description\":\"Manage tasks, history, pinned items, and archived conversations in MiniMax Code.\",\"href\":\"/code/workflows/tasks\"},{\"title\":\"Conversation Collaboration\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Conversation Collaboration\",\"description\":\"Quote, comment on, and rate Agent replies directly in a conversation.\",\"href\":\"/code/workflows/conversation-collaboration\"},{\"title\":\"Code Review\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Code Review\",\"description\":\"Use the built-in Review command to inspect local code changes.\",\"href\":\"/code/workflows/code-review\"},{\"title\":\"Permissions and Safety\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Permissions and Safety\",\"description\":\"Understand how MiniMax Code handles permission prompts for local files, commands, and external actions.\",\"href\":\"/code/workflows/permissions\"}]},{\"group\":\"Desktop Features\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Infinite Canvas\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Infinite Canvas\",\"description\":\"Bring your assets, ideas, and generated results onto one canvas, and create alongside your Agent.\",\"href\":\"/code/desktop/infinite-canvas\"},{\"title\":\"Goal\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Goal\",\"description\":\"Set a verifiable outcome for MiniMax Code and let it keep working until the goal is achieved or progress is blocked.\",\"href\":\"/code/desktop/goal\"},{\"title\":\"Built-in Browser\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Built-in Browser\",\"description\":\"Open pages, preview generated HTML, and debug web work inside the MiniMax Code task view.\",\"href\":\"/code/desktop/browser\"},{\"title\":\"Computer Use\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Computer Use\",\"description\":\"Let MiniMax Code operate apps on your computer directly for tasks that need a graphical interface.\",\"href\":\"/code/desktop/computer-use\"},{\"title\":\"Files / Changes / Terminal Panels\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Developer Panels\",\"description\":\"Use MiniMax Code panels to inspect files, code changes, and command output.\",\"href\":\"/code/desktop/panels\"},{\"title\":\"Appearance\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Appearance\",\"description\":\"Adjust the display mode, theme, density, fonts, and colors of MiniMax Code.\",\"href\":\"/code/desktop/appearance\"},{\"title\":\"Shortcuts and Mini Window\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Shortcuts and Mini Window\",\"description\":\"Use global shortcuts, command palette, and the mini window to work faster.\",\"href\":\"/code/desktop/shortcuts\"},{\"title\":\"Updates and Feedback\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Updates and Feedback\",\"description\":\"Check for MiniMax Code updates and submit feedback tickets from the desktop app.\",\"href\":\"/code/desktop/updates-feedback\"}]},{\"group\":\"Agent Capabilities\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Agent Team\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Agent Team\",\"description\":\"Use Agent Team for complex tasks that benefit from decomposition, collaboration, and verification.\",\"href\":\"/code/agents/team\"},{\"title\":\"Custom Agents\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Custom Agents\",\"description\":\"Create dedicated Agents with their own role, instructions, skills, workspace, and channels.\",\"href\":\"/code/agents/custom-agents\"},{\"title\":\"Custom Mini Apps\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Custom Mini Apps\",\"description\":\"Bring information, tools, and everyday tasks together in one interface.\",\"href\":\"/code/agents/mini-apps\"},{\"title\":\"MiniApp Overview\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"MiniApp Overview\",\"description\":\"What MiniApp is, how it runs and is published, what is planned next, and two official examples: stocks and road trip planning.\",\"href\":\"/code/agents/miniapp-overview\"},{\"title\":\"H3 Max Video Generation\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"H3 Max Video Generation\",\"description\":\"Create videos with sound from text prompts and reference media in MiniMax Code.\",\"href\":\"/code/agents/h3-max\"},{\"title\":\"Plugin Marketplace\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Plugin Marketplace\",\"description\":\"Install and use domain plugins in MiniMax Code.\",\"href\":\"/code/agents/plugins\"},{\"title\":\"Plugin Development and Submission Guide\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Plugin Submission\",\"description\":\"Capability choices, package layout, manifest fields, Skills and MCP servers, size limits, and the submission process for MiniMax Plugins.\",\"href\":\"/code/agents/plugin-submission\"},{\"title\":\"MCP Servers\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"MCP Servers\",\"description\":\"Connect external tools and data sources to MiniMax Code.\",\"href\":\"/code/agents/mcp\"},{\"title\":\"Memory\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Memory\",\"description\":\"Let MiniMax Code retain useful preferences, project conventions, and long-term working patterns.\",\"href\":\"/code/agents/memory\"}]},{\"group\":\"Automation \u0026 Remote\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Scheduled Tasks\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Scheduled Tasks\",\"description\":\"Let Agents run recurring work on a schedule.\",\"href\":\"/code/automation/schedules\"},{\"title\":\"Remote Control\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Remote Control\",\"description\":\"Connect to your desktop Agent from your phone to check progress, add instructions, and approve permissions.\",\"href\":\"/code/automation/remote-control\"},{\"title\":\"Messaging Integrations\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Messaging Integrations\",\"description\":\"Collaborate with Agents through Telegram, WeChat, Lark, or Feishu depending on the locale.\",\"href\":\"/code/automation/im\"}]},{\"group\":\"Models \u0026 Account\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"M Plan and Credits\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"M Plan and Credits\",\"description\":\"View your MiniMax Code subscription plan, credit balance, and usage quotas.\",\"href\":\"/code/account/usage\"},{\"title\":\"MiniMax API Key\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"MiniMax API Key\",\"description\":\"Configure your own MiniMax API key in MiniMax Code.\",\"href\":\"/code/account/minimax-api\"},{\"title\":\"Custom Models / BYOK\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Custom Models / BYOK\",\"description\":\"Add a custom model provider with base URL, API key, API format, and model names.\",\"href\":\"/code/account/byok\"},{\"title\":\"Configure BYOK Models with an Agent\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Agent Setup Guide\",\"description\":\"Configure custom models with an agent and verify real responses using curl on macOS and Windows.\",\"href\":\"/code/account/byok-agent-setup\"}]},{\"group\":\"Help\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"FAQ\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"FAQ\",\"description\":\"Frequently asked questions about MiniMax Code desktop.\",\"href\":\"/code/help/faq\"},{\"title\":\"Feedback\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Feedback\",\"description\":\"Submit reproduction details, screenshots, and diagnostics when reporting issues.\",\"href\":\"/code/help/feedback\"}]}]},{\"tab\":\"CLI\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Quick Start\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Quick Start\",\"description\":\"Install MiniMax Code CLI, sign in, and complete your first terminal task.\",\"href\":\"/cli/quick-start\"},{\"title\":\"Features and configuration\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Features and configuration\",\"description\":\"Learn about MiniMax Code CLI entry points, interactive capabilities, configuration, and integrations.\",\"href\":\"/cli/features\"},{\"title\":\"Workflows\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Workflows\",\"description\":\"Use MiniMax Code CLI for repository work, multi-turn tasks, plans, permissions, and session recovery.\",\"href\":\"/cli/workflows\"},{\"title\":\"Configuration and models\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Configuration and models\",\"description\":\"Configure MiniMax Code CLI data directories, credentials, providers, models, 