n-operate-and-observe-the-real-product\",\"depth\":3,\"children\":[]},{\"title\":\"4. Plans and progress live in files in the repo\",\"slug\":\"4-plans-and-progress-live-in-files-in-the-repo\",\"depth\":3,\"children\":[]},{\"title\":\"5. Someone else decides whether it’s right\",\"slug\":\"5-someone-else-decides-whether-it’s-right\",\"depth\":3,\"children\":[]},{\"title\":\"6. When the agent gets stuck, fix the repo, not the prompt\",\"slug\":\"6-when-the-agent-gets-stuck-fix-the-repo-not-the-prompt\",\"depth\":3,\"children\":[]},{\"title\":\"7. Add complexity only when it pays, one piece at a time\",\"slug\":\"7-add-complexity-only-when-it-pays-one-piece-at-a-time\",\"depth\":3,\"children\":[]}]},{\"title\":\"How to use it\",\"slug\":\"how-to-use-it\",\"depth\":2,\"children\":[]},{\"title\":\"Sources\",\"slug\":\"sources\",\"depth\":2,\"children\":[]}],\"codeExamples\":{}},\"pageType\":\"$undefined\",\"panelMdxSource\":\"$undefined\",\"panelMdxSourceWithNoJs\":\"$undefined\",\"contextualStarterQuestions\":\"$undefined\",\"relatedPages\":\"$undefined\",\"relatedPagesConfig\":\"$undefined\",\"narration\":\"$undefined\"},\"children\":\"$L46\"}]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"47:I[604780,[\"/docs/_next/static/chunks/0ea0e179f06dc225.js?dpl=dpl_FHTuezYwhxFJmZtMvTojAU2mWDym\",\"/docs/_next/static/chunks/1e7a188add93a653.js?dpl=dpl_FHTuezYwhxFJmZtMvTojAU2mWDym\",\"/docs/_next/static/chunks/343f3c7f568a2e5d.js?dpl=dpl_FHTuezYwhxFJmZtMvTojAU2mWDym\",\"/docs/_next/static/chunks/e1183f8000d79566.js?dpl=dpl_FHTuezYwhxFJmZtMvTojAU2mWDym\",\"/docs/_next/static/chunks/ccee8d9b3189ccd9.js?dpl=dpl_FHTuezYwhxFJmZtMvTojAU2mWDym\",\"/docs/_next/static/chunks/0963882fe4bf3b50.js?dpl=dpl_FHTuezYwhxFJmZtMvTojAU2mWDym\",\"/docs/_next/static/chunks/8a19ec8c194a3b47.js?dpl=dpl_FHTuezYwhxFJmZtMvTojAU2mWDym\",\"/docs/_next/static/chunks/d6a774160f99cc71.js?dpl=dpl_FHTuezYwhxFJmZtMvTojAU2mWDym\",\"/docs/_next/static/chunks/8d0901e40ed4b058.js?dpl=dpl_FHTuezYwhxFJmZtMvTojAU2mWD